        "Description": "Hello 47 , After pulling the data of the scientist that you eliminated in Sapianza. We track down Where the Weoponize Rabies virus is Made at , A Milita Terrorist Group in Colorado by the name of Ezra Berg has been mass producing these virus to help the Syndicate . Apparently he is not alone , Sean Rose a buddy of Berg help him Distribute the virus to the Syndicate locations with the help of 3 Hackers Confirming the Deliveries , If we manage to Eliminate them we can Serverly cut their virus arm",
